<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for an eleventh tranche of 1.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with an 7.50 pct coupon, and an eleventh tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 7.75 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		   Oct 1,1999	Pvs    Sept 15,2001    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.32 pct    5.40 pct    5.74 pct     5.76 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.26 pct    6.34 pct    6.71 pct     6.73 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 103.35	 103.20     104.55	  104.50</p>
<p> Bids	     3.900 trln lire	   3.103 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 1.500 trln lire	   1.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on November 29 of a ninth tranche of three and five-year Btps.</p>
</text>
